# Source and internal docs are NOT visitor material. Cloudflare Pages deploys the
# whole repo root, and .assetsignore is a Workers Assets feature that a Pages git
# deployment ignores entirely -- so until 2026-08-07 every one of these answered
# 200 on the live site. Blocked here because this is the only mechanism that
# applies to a Pages git build without touching the dashboard.
/docs/*         /404.html       404
/tools/*        /404.html       404
/CLAUDE.md      /404.html       404
/README.md      /404.html       404
/wrangler.jsonc /404.html       404

